WEBVTT

00:25.520 --> 00:26.540
<b>Here’s the lighttime!</b>

00:26.730 --> 00:28.680
<b>Will you guys click the follow button?</b>

00:28.680 --> 00:29.240
<b>Come on!</b>

00:30.320 --> 00:31.680
<b>Lu Guang, say something!</b>

00:33.410 --> 00:35.080
<b>Follow us, please!</b>

00:37.770 --> 00:39.310
<b>Mr. Lu, Mr. Lu!</b>

00:41.020 --> 00:42.060
<b>Damn it, it's locked.</b>

00:42.060 --> 00:42.430
<b>The next step
Damn it, it's locked.</b>

00:42.430 --> 00:43.010
<b>Break the door open!
The next step</b>

00:43.010 --> 00:43.220
<b>Break the door open!</b>

00:43.680 --> 00:44.940
<b>The next step should be…</b>

00:51.480 --> 00:54.040
<b>He must have broken the window to distract your attention</b>

00:54.290 --> 00:56.200
<b>and then hid in the restroom to escape.</b>

01:13.720 --> 01:15.220
<b>You two, check the situation downstairs now.</b>

01:15.310 --> 01:16.390
<b>I’m calling Captain Xiao.</b>

01:40.100 --> 01:42.600
<b>No, why did I get discovered?</b>

01:52.940 --> 01:54.580
<b>Hey, check the surveillance footage right now.</b>

01:54.650 --> 01:55.680
<b>OK.</b>

02:07.810 --> 02:09.780
<b>By the way, ask someone to inspect the scene.</b>

02:11.830 --> 02:13.390
<b>We also need to set patrol points around this area.</b>

02:21.000 --> 02:22.880
<b>How does the phone run out of battery so quickly?</b>

02:22.990 --> 02:23.980
<b>What about yours</b>

02:24.680 --> 02:25.360
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

02:25.360 --> 02:27.180
<b>Didn’t you charge it fully before going out?</b>

02:30.240 --> 02:31.720
<b>These coincidences did not happen by chance.</b>

02:40.750 --> 02:42.020
<b>You eat so little.</b>

02:42.180 --> 02:43.800
<b>What if you get hungry during the night shift?</b>

02:43.940 --> 02:45.540
<b>Never mind. I can endure it.</b>

02:46.230 --> 02:48.890
<b>Is it Ouyang Bubai who ran over just now?</b>

02:49.200 --> 02:49.980
<b>How can it be?</b>

02:50.280 --> 02:52.140
<b>He’s badly injured. How could he run so fast?</b>

02:53.330 --> 02:54.700
<b>Qiao Ling was right.</b>

02:55.130 --> 02:56.100
<b>I believe</b>

02:56.720 --> 02:58.820
<b>the past that has already happened will inevitably exist.</b>

02:59.180 --> 03:00.810
<b>Even if there are countless possibilities,</b>

03:01.680 --> 03:03.700
<b>Lu Guang sacrificed himself to save you</b>

03:03.940 --> 03:05.700
<b>This is the inevitable destiny.</b>

03:07.700 --> 03:11.450
<b>Past or future, just let them be</b>

05:06.220 --> 05:12.100
<b>Inevitable Tragedy
Part 1</b>

05:13.360 --> 05:14.810
<b>The orchard walls are high and hard to climb,</b>

05:15.300 --> 05:17.060
<b>and the place death, considering who thou art,</b>

05:17.060 --> 05:18.240
<b>if any of my kinsmen find thee here.</b>

05:18.800 --> 05:20.660
<b>With love's light wings did I o'er-perch these walls</b>

05:20.900 --> 05:23.970
<b>for stony limits cannot hold love out,</b>

05:24.250 --> 05:25.660
<b>and what love can do</b>

05:25.820 --> 05:27.290
<b>that dares love attempt</b>

05:27.850 --> 05:31.060
<b>therefore thy kinsmen are no let to me.</b>

05:33.910 --> 05:35.240
<b>If they do see thee,</b>

05:35.680 --> 05:37.210
<b>they will murder thee.</b>

05:38.010 --> 05:40.460
<b>There lies more peril in thine eye than twenty of their swords</b>

05:40.880 --> 05:42.650
<b>Look thou but sweet,</b>

05:43.260 --> 05:45.560
<b>and I am proof against their enmity.</b>

06:16.380 --> 06:17.790
<b>Today's performance was a great success.</b>

06:18.000 --> 06:19.380
<b>I couldn't hold my tears.</b>

06:20.340 --> 06:22.140
<b>This is my husband, Qian Jin.</b>

06:23.120 --> 06:25.350
<b>Lisa often mentions you.</b>

06:25.700 --> 06:27.000
<b>The great detective, Captain Qian</b>

06:27.720 --> 06:29.680
<b>You must be the Da Shuai, right?</b>

06:30.110 --> 06:30.920
<b>No, no, no.</b>

06:31.460 --> 06:32.860
<b>Just call me Zhuang Shuai.</b>

06:33.120 --> 06:34.520
<b>She often praises your acting skills.</b>

06:34.780 --> 06:35.520
<b>And you teach her a lot.</b>

06:36.360 --> 06:38.300
<b>Lisa herself is a talented actress.</b>

06:38.700 --> 06:42.970
<b>What a pity. Nowadays, people who can appreciate such elegant art</b>

06:42.970 --> 06:44.090
<b>are fewer and fewer.</b>

06:45.180 --> 06:46.220
<b>Well, you promised</b>

06:46.600 --> 06:47.990
<b>to support my career.</b>

06:47.990 --> 06:48.780
<b>Of course.</b>

06:49.350 --> 06:49.900
<b>By the way,</b>

06:50.450 --> 06:53.080
<b>How’s the new venue you visited together the day before yesterday?</b>

06:53.230 --> 06:55.400
<b>I heard the rent is lower.</b>

06:56.770 --> 06:57.620
<b>The day before yesterday</b>

06:58.540 --> 06:59.850
<b>New venue</b>

07:00.180 --> 07:01.580
<b>We haven't found a suitable one yet.</b>

07:02.570 --> 07:04.840
<b>That old plant on Tiantong Road.</b>

07:04.840 --> 07:06.780
<b>We went to see it after dinner that evening.</b>

07:08.820 --> 07:10.340
<b>I thought we would just take a look.</b>

07:10.680 --> 07:11.400
<b>It’s too expensive.</b>

07:11.400 --> 07:12.930
<b>I never thought we could rent it.</b>

07:13.630 --> 07:14.570
<b>Tiantong Road.</b>

07:16.020 --> 07:19.860
<b>I remember that the old plant was rebuilt into commercial offices.</b>

07:20.270 --> 07:23.230
<b>There's a really tiny area at the back.</b>

07:23.450 --> 07:25.110
<b>It's a bit inadequate for office use.</b>

07:25.110 --> 07:26.780
<b>So they secretly advertised it for rent.</b>

07:26.780 --> 07:27.940
<b>Come on</b>

07:27.940 --> 07:28.820
<b>Let’s have a meal together</b>

07:29.070 --> 07:30.480
<b>Count me out.</b>

07:30.910 --> 07:32.500
<b>I don’t wanna be a third wheel.</b>

07:36.870 --> 07:39.570
<b>Captain Qian. Captain Qian</b>

07:41.120 --> 07:41.820
<b>Captain Qian</b>

07:44.150 --> 07:44.880
<b>Chen</b>

07:45.520 --> 07:46.410
<b>What brings you here?</b>

07:46.880 --> 07:49.090
<b>Are you used to working with Xiao Li?</b>

07:50.040 --> 07:50.810
<b>Capatin Qian.</b>

07:51.380 --> 07:53.540
<b>I heard that you haven't been doing well lately.</b>

07:53.540 --> 07:54.700
<b>So I came to see you.</b>

07:55.580 --> 07:56.640
<b>And it’s true</b>

07:57.180 --> 07:58.330
<b>Why are you so absent-minded?</b>

07:59.610 --> 08:00.190
<b>Nothing.</b>

08:00.500 --> 08:02.930
<b>It’s common for us to stay up all night.</b>

08:04.480 --> 08:07.400
<b>As I get older, I’m not so resilient as before.</b>

08:08.160 --> 08:10.840
<b>You should spend more time with your wife when available.</b>

08:11.080 --> 08:13.080
<b>She must be lonely when she's home alone.</b>

08:13.580 --> 08:16.130
<b>My girlfriend has complained to me several times too.</b>

08:16.850 --> 08:18.340
<b>You are about to get married, right?</b>

08:18.820 --> 08:19.830
<b>She's a good girl.</b>

08:19.950 --> 08:21.120
<b>Don’t miss your chance.</b>

08:22.130 --> 08:23.460
<b>I’m talking about you.</b>

08:23.460 --> 08:24.560
<b>Why are you throwing it back at me?</b>

08:26.050 --> 08:27.400
<b>My wife…</b>

08:28.880 --> 08:29.900
<b>Nope</b>

08:29.900 --> 08:31.420
<b>Just stay by myself.</b>

08:33.340 --> 08:34.420
<b>What can I do?</b>

08:34.760 --> 08:36.390
<b>I've been living like this for so many years.</b>

08:37.540 --> 08:39.190
<b>But recently, I don't know what’s wrong.</b>

08:39.510 --> 08:43.220
<b>My back always feels sore after just a few performances</b>

08:43.520 --> 08:45.010
<b>Sometimes I can't even stand up straight.</b>

08:45.780 --> 08:47.080
<b>She's busy with her own stuff.</b>

08:48.230 --> 08:50.740
<b>Pah, what are you talking about?</b>

08:55.320 --> 08:57.230
<b>Who said I can't fit into it?</b>

08:57.460 --> 08:59.790
<b>Just a few pounds after I got married.</b>

09:00.080 --> 09:01.820
<b>I can lose weight by eating less at night.</b>

09:06.630 --> 09:08.190
<b>Qian Jin, enough.</b>

09:09.380 --> 09:10.260
<b>Don’t drink too much.</b>

09:27.880 --> 09:28.760
<b>Tell me</b>

09:29.020 --> 09:30.750
<b>What's the point</b>

09:31.120 --> 09:32.980
<b>of working so hard?</b>

09:33.820 --> 09:36.190
<b>We can't even keep our wives loyal.</b>

09:39.090 --> 09:40.200
<b>Xiao Li</b>

09:41.170 --> 09:44.860
<b>Tell me, whose fault is it?</b>

09:46.500 --> 09:47.330
<b>My fault?</b>

09:48.740 --> 09:50.150
<b>His fault?</b>

09:51.890 --> 09:53.280
<b>Or her fault?</b>

09:54.750 --> 09:56.200
<b>Tell me.</b>

09:59.720 --> 10:01.360
<b>Why are you so silent?</b>

10:02.960 --> 10:06.200
<b>Qian Jin, there's something</b>

10:07.870 --> 10:08.940
<b>I should have told you before.</b>

10:51.310 --> 10:52.560
<b>Part 2</b>

10:52.560 --> 10:57.180
<b>Fortuitous Comedy
Part 2</b>

11:14.600 --> 11:16.460
<b>Captain Qian, what brings you here?</b>

11:17.570 --> 11:18.320
<b>Tell me about the case.</b>

11:19.190 --> 11:20.520
<b>You just finished your family affairs.</b>

11:20.760 --> 11:22.280
<b>We will stay here to keep watch.</b>

11:22.500 --> 11:23.380
<b>Why not…</b>

11:25.600 --> 11:26.960
<b>The deceased are a married couple.</b>

11:27.180 --> 11:28.800
<b>The woman's name is Liu Lan, 38 years old.</b>

11:29.190 --> 11:30.960
<b>The man's name is Li Fan, 42 years old.</b>

11:31.500 --> 11:33.390
<b>The informant is their neighbor, Mr. Deng.</b>

11:33.760 --> 11:36.100
<b>He noticed there might be domestic violence next door</b>

11:36.100 --> 11:37.140
<b>So he called the police.</b>

11:38.500 --> 11:41.060
<b>Later, the patrol officers arrived and kept knocking on the door, but nobody answered.</b>

11:41.480 --> 11:42.760
<b>Upon forced entry, they discovered that</b>

11:42.860 --> 11:44.300
<b>both of them had no vital signs.</b>

11:45.660 --> 11:46.890
<b>Based on the situation on scene,</b>

11:47.080 --> 11:50.010
<b>it appears that they accidentally killed each other during a fight.</b>

11:50.760 --> 11:53.530
<b>The weapons should be their household knife and hammer.</b>

12:00.500 --> 12:01.680
<b>This is the informant.</b>

12:12.010 --> 12:13.880
<b>Oh, sorry</b>

12:13.880 --> 12:14.920
<b>I got distracted.</b>

12:15.240 --> 12:16.430
<b>Could you repeat the question?</b>

12:16.900 --> 12:17.510
<b>By the way</b>

12:17.820 --> 12:19.870
<b>there were two children of Liu Lan on the scene.</b>

12:20.440 --> 12:21.380
<b>When we arrived</b>

12:21.520 --> 12:23.140
<b>the boy was holding his younger sister tightly.</b>

12:35.200 --> 12:36.020
<b>Captain Qian</b>

12:49.780 --> 12:52.600
<b>Could you tell me what exactly happened?</b>

12:54.570 --> 12:56.100
<b>It was I who killed them.</b>

13:25.840 --> 13:28.020
<b>Then you live with him.</b>

13:29.340 --> 13:30.740
<b>I remember that you told me</b>

13:31.310 --> 13:32.870
<b>to become the hunter in the jungle.</b>

13:33.740 --> 13:34.560
<b>Right.</b>

13:37.210 --> 13:38.880
<b>Now, what do you think of me?</b>

13:41.760 --> 13:43.280
<b>A wounded wild beast.</b>

13:44.760 --> 13:45.590
<b>Do you know</b>

13:46.420 --> 13:48.400
<b>the difference between a beast and a hunter?</b>

13:49.870 --> 13:51.450
<b>Beasts are more ferocious.</b>

13:52.740 --> 13:54.160
<b>Hunters are more cunning.</b>

13:56.720 --> 13:57.500
<b>Wrong</b>

13:58.410 --> 13:59.240
<b>Beasts</b>

13:59.690 --> 14:01.230
<b>only hunt when they are hungry.</b>

14:02.140 --> 14:03.280
<b>But hunters are different.</b>

14:03.680 --> 14:04.810
<b>Mr. Liu,</b>

14:10.660 --> 14:12.200
<b>I believe in the near future</b>

14:13.060 --> 14:14.340
<b>You will definitely encounter</b>

14:15.040 --> 14:16.690
<b>the opportunity to be a hunter.</b>

14:17.570 --> 14:18.640
<b>It’s almost the time</b>

14:18.870 --> 14:20.600
<b>You'll be late if you don't leave now.</b>

14:21.580 --> 14:23.080
<b>Will we meet again?</b>

14:25.340 --> 14:26.660
<b>Surely we will.</b>

14:38.740 --> 14:40.790
<b>Who are you looking for?</b>

14:42.800 --> 14:44.530
<b>Mr. Liu, Liu Jing, asked me to come.</b>

14:47.390 --> 14:48.340
<b>Mr. Liu,</b>

14:48.660 --> 14:50.640
<b>The guest said he’s looking for your father.</b>

14:55.020 --> 14:56.440
<b>I invited them.</b>

14:57.130 --> 14:58.430
<b>Let them in.</b>

15:07.840 --> 15:09.500
<b>Come on, enjoy yourself.</b>

15:09.900 --> 15:10.320
<b>Thank you.</b>

15:12.590 --> 15:14.700
<b>I heard from your father about your experience,</b>

15:15.310 --> 15:16.160
<b>I really feel sorry about that.</b>

15:18.240 --> 15:20.560
<b>I know it was thanks to you that the matters about that woman could be solved.</b>

15:22.990 --> 15:24.900
<b>What can I do for you?</b>

15:27.170 --> 15:28.060
<b>Who’s this?</b>

15:28.940 --> 15:30.730
<b>He looks quite familiar.</b>

15:33.570 --> 15:33.980
<b>Hey</b>

15:34.660 --> 15:36.120
<b>Have we met somewhere before?</b>

15:39.180 --> 15:40.960
<b>Is he dumb?</b>

15:41.680 --> 15:42.710
<b>Mr. Liu</b>

15:43.020 --> 15:44.220
<b>Shall we just focus on the matter</b>

15:44.220 --> 15:44.940
<b>No need to curse at others.</b>

15:45.760 --> 15:47.040
<b>Curse</b>

15:48.240 --> 15:50.970
<b>Those keyboard warriors attack me day and night</b>

15:50.970 --> 15:52.280
<b>That's what you call ‘curse at others’.</b>

15:53.120 --> 15:55.130
<b>I heard that you've helped my father a lot</b>

15:55.820 --> 15:58.650
<b>Can you do me a favor as well?</b>

15:59.300 --> 16:00.240
<b>I can help you</b>

16:00.240 --> 16:03.010
<b>by sending legal letters to those who have seriously defamed you online</b>

16:03.390 --> 16:04.080
<b>as a warning.</b>

16:05.870 --> 16:06.820
<b>Could it work?</b>

16:10.230 --> 16:11.990
<b>Don't deceive yourself</b>

16:12.370 --> 16:13.290
<b>Are you kidding me</b>

16:15.680 --> 16:19.780
<b>I want those who lead the online insults against me to shut up forever.</b>

16:25.900 --> 16:30.070
<b>I know you can do it</b>

16:42.410 --> 16:43.180
<b>Mr. Liu</b>

16:44.300 --> 16:46.680
<b>You must be joking after drinking so much</b>

16:47.440 --> 16:49.660
<b>I've already picked one</b>

16:55.620 --> 16:56.480
<b>To do this,</b>

16:57.240 --> 16:58.340
<b>you should not count on me.</b>

17:00.360 --> 17:01.820
<b>It depends on if he’s willing or not.</b>

17:15.920 --> 17:18.280
<b>So you're not deaf or dumb</b>

17:20.060 --> 17:22.720
<b>He’s laughing. Does this mean he agrees?</b>

17:44.270 --> 17:45.470
<b>Part 3</b>

17:45.470 --> 17:50.020
<b>Siblings' Fairy Tale
Part 3</b>

18:30.820 --> 18:31.590
<b>You know what</b>

18:32.560 --> 18:35.960
<b>That male teacher seems interested in this lady</b>

18:36.310 --> 18:39.460
<b>No wonder he comes here so often.</b>

18:49.970 --> 18:51.340
<b>They must be close to each other.</b>

18:51.680 --> 18:53.160
<b>I saw it all</b>

19:18.990 --> 19:20.700
<b>She betrayed you</b>

19:22.430 --> 19:24.590
<b>Cuckold, cuckold.</b>

19:28.640 --> 19:31.480
<b>How could a man stand such humiliation?</b>

19:32.380 --> 19:34.810
<b>You have become everyone's joke.</b>

22:08.470 --> 22:11.840
<b>Sorry. Sorry.</b>

22:15.120 --> 22:17.680
<b>Sorry. Sorry.</b>

22:49.580 --> 22:53.910
<b>Qian Jin, there's something I should have told you before.</b>

22:54.420 --> 22:58.430
<b>Your wife was pregnant when she was murdered.</b>

22:59.670 --> 23:00.640
<b>So</b>

23:36.540 --> 23:38.860
<b>you're not deaf or dumb</b>

23:40.540 --> 23:43.480
<b>He’s laughing. Does this mean he agrees?</b>

23:55.660 --> 23:59.030
<b>That male teacher seems interested in this lady</b>

23:59.960 --> 24:03.420
<b>No wonder he comes here so often.</b>

24:04.810 --> 24:06.360
<b>They must be close to each other.</b>

24:06.360 --> 24:07.680
<b>I saw it all</b>

24:21.080 --> 24:21.910
<b>Bro</b>

24:22.700 --> 24:26.620
<b>A toast to the death of a scumbag in the world.</b>

24:32.170 --> 24:33.660
<b>I believe in the near future</b>

24:34.260 --> 24:35.790
<b>You will definitely encounter</b>

24:36.550 --> 24:38.120
<b>the opportunity to be a hunter.</b>

24:56.950 --> 24:57.620
<b>I believe</b>

24:58.690 --> 25:00.690
<b>the past that has already happened will inevitably exist.</b>

25:01.960 --> 25:03.610
<b>Even if there are countless possibilities,</b>

25:04.760 --> 25:06.840
<b>Lu Guang sacrificed himself to save you</b>

25:08.010 --> 25:09.640
<b>This is the inevitable destiny.</b>

25:09.640 --> 25:10.640
<b>Finale
This is the inevitable destiny.</b>

25:10.640 --> 25:11.590
<b>Inevitable Destiny
Finale
This is the inevitable destiny.</b>

25:11.590 --> 25:14.180
<b>Finale
Inevitable Destiny</b>

25:26.290 --> 25:27.140
<b>Lu Guang</b>

25:27.530 --> 25:28.790
<b>Why are you here?</b>

25:38.620 --> 25:39.640
<b>What’s going on?</b>

25:40.220 --> 25:41.970
<b>Where am I?</b>

25:41.970 --> 25:43.040
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi</b>

25:49.710 --> 25:51.670
<b>In this inevitable destiny,</b>

25:52.420 --> 25:55.720
<b>All coincidences will eventually be inevitable.</b>

25:56.850 --> 25:57.500
<b>But</b>

26:00.180 --> 26:01.820
<b>Sorry, Lu Guang</b>

26:03.190 --> 26:03.850
<b>Because of you</b>

26:05.240 --> 26:07.570
<b>I don't wanna proceed down this path.</b>
